(3337865, 464963, 21714, '<td valign="top">The colours are nice, and I like the andle of light, but I also think that some deeper shadows would have helped to show some texture and detail. The composition looks a bit out of balance - me wanting to see a bit more on the top and not wanting the space on left and bottom, mainly just wanting to see a bit more at the top.</td>', 'The colours are nice, and I like the andle of light, but I also think that some deeper shadows would have helped to show some texture and detail. The composition looks a bit out of balance - me wanting to see a bit more on the top and not wanting the space on left and bottom, mainly just wanting to see a bit more at the top.', '2007-02-07 02:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
