(3337928, 464613, 37344, '<td valign="top">Too much red. Maybe it really was that red, but I doubt it. The water - maybe. Water reflects colors fairly well. The rocks and the sand - no way. Makes the whole photo <i>look</i> fake.</td>', 'Too much red. Maybe it really was that red, but I doubt it. The water - maybe. Water reflects colors fairly well. The rocks and the sand - no way. Makes the whole photo look fake.', '2007-02-07 03:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3337932, 461889, 37344, '<td valign="top">The colors are too yellow. Maybe it was an attempt at artistry. Dunno. I just know the color is not working for me.<br/> <br/>I like the three groups of kids, but I would have left a little more space around the edges, especially on the lower left child.</td>', 'The colors are too yellow. Maybe it was an attempt at artistry. Dunno. I just know the color is not working for me. I like the three groups of kids, but I would have left a little more space around the edges, especially on the lower left child.', '2007-02-07 03:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3337934, 463668, 70975, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure everyone will agree with this being in the "good" challenge.  In B&amp;W the image is flat and lifeless and I don''t think it strikes much of an emotive feel</td>', 'I''m not sure everyone will agree with this being in the "good" challenge.  In B&W the image is flat and lifeless and I don''t think it strikes much of an emotive feel', '2007-02-07 03:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
