(3337936, 463708, 37344, '<td valign="top">Maybe use some sort of light weight cloth or paper to reduce the glare on the figurine. I''m guessing you tried that, and it ruined the shadow. Dunno, but that glare sticks out like a sore thumb.</td>', 'Maybe use some sort of light weight cloth or paper to reduce the glare on the figurine. I''m guessing you tried that, and it ruined the shadow. Dunno, but that glare sticks out like a sore thumb.', '2007-02-07 03:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
