(3337942, 464626, 37344, '<td valign="top">Try shooting in raw, and using either Photoshop (not elements) or RawShooter Essentials (free for a little while longer), so you can adjust in 12+ bits. Then you won''t get the rings around the sun - more bits = smoother skies (generally speaking).</td>', 'Try shooting in raw, and using either Photoshop (not elements) or RawShooter Essentials (free for a little while longer), so you can adjust in 12+ bits. Then you won''t get the rings around the sun - more bits = smoother skies (generally speaking).', '2007-02-07 03:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3337949, 465102, 70975, '<td valign="top">The hair is so bad it is good</td>', 'The hair is so bad it is good', '2007-02-07 03:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3337951, 461777, 37344, '<td valign="top">Why is the knuckle in focus instead of the cards?<br/> <br/>Poor composition - try adding a little more space near the top or somthing. Google "rule of thirds" for ideas.</td>', 'Why is the knuckle in focus instead of the cards? Poor composition - try adding a little more space near the top or somthing. Google "rule of thirds" for ideas.', '2007-02-07 03:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
