(3340701, 463326, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Yes he is!  And so is this AWESOME photo!   And my best score so far to go with it!  This is one of the best surfer pictures I think I''ve ever seen.  The black and white is beautiful!  And I love it that he is mostly silhouetted with just a little bit of light on his face and the surfboard.  I''d give this a 20 if I could -- but 10 will have to do.  I''d love to see this one with a ribbon.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow!  Yes he is!  And so is this AWESOME photo!   And my best score so far to go with it!  This is one of the best surfer pictures I think I''ve ever seen.  The black and white is beautiful!  And I love it that he is mostly silhouetted with just a little bit of light on his face and the surfboard.  I''d give this a 20 if I could -- but 10 will have to do.  I''d love to see this one with a ribbon.  Good luck!', '2007-02-07 17:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
