(3345509, 464779, 66515, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of this shot. The candid feeling you''ve captured is also remarkable. It doesn''t feel posed at all to me. It also ties quite well with the challenge. Even though there are a lot of variations to the spritual take on the challenge, this is still a fresh take on that aspect of "good".<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of this shot. The candid feeling you''ve captured is also remarkable. It doesn''t feel posed at all to me. It also ties quite well with the challenge. Even though there are a lot of variations to the spritual take on the challenge, this is still a fresh take on that aspect of "good". 10', '2007-02-08 19:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345513, 464963, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely color and focus. The crop is too tight at the top, cutting off part of that flower.</td>', 'Lovely color and focus. The crop is too tight at the top, cutting off part of that flower.', '2007-02-08 19:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345517, 463295, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but not really conveyed well. I toyed with this approach myself (that is Good Friday) and to be honest the idea of pointing out the date on a calendar really didn''t seem to have a lot of appeal to me. <br/> <br/>Technically the image is sound however. Using a different angle and composing the shot so that the date was more prevalent would help though.</td>', 'Interesting idea but not really conveyed well. I toyed with this approach myself (that is Good Friday) and to be honest the idea of pointing out the date on a calendar really didn''t seem to have a lot of appeal to me.  Technically the image is sound however. Using a different angle and composing the shot so that the date was more prevalent would help though.', '2007-02-08 19:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345525, 464315, 66515, '<td valign="top">I have to ask: What the heck happened to his head????. Cranial gigantism indeed! <br/> <br/>That aside, it would be nice if the duck was on the right hand side of the frame and thus swimming INTO the picture rathen than out of it. The way this is currently composed all I see is duck and duck-reflection. Everything else is a distraction rather than complementing your subject. <br/> <br/>You could also make this a bit stronger by cropping off everything below the reflection. <br/> <br/>In terms of how it meets the challenge? Not especially strong but I won''t disagree that ducks are good.</td>', 'I have to ask: What the heck happened to his head????. Cranial gigantism indeed!  That aside, it would be nice if the duck was on the right hand side of the frame and thus swimming INTO the picture rathen than out of it. The way this is currently composed all I see is duck and duck-reflection. Everything else is a distraction rather than complementing your subject.  You could also make this a bit stronger by cropping off everything below the reflection.  In terms of how it meets the challenge? Not especially strong but I won''t disagree that ducks are good.', '2007-02-08 19:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345528, 464899, 20608, '<td valign="top">And I smell good too, just had a bath</td>', 'And I smell good too, just had a bath', '2007-02-08 19:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345540, 465065, 66515, '<td valign="top">The sky appears a bit dark to me at the top. I do like the composition though. The shadows draw your eyes upwards towards the top of the roof. Had the sky been less dark, the roof would have stood out more making the subject pop more.</td>', 'The sky appears a bit dark to me at the top. I do like the composition though. The shadows draw your eyes upwards towards the top of the roof. Had the sky been less dark, the roof would have stood out more making the subject pop more.', '2007-02-08 19:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345547, 464145, 50255, '<td valign="top">A little soft on the focus but very sweet.  Wish I had one like that of my grandmother!</td>', 'A little soft on the focus but very sweet.  Wish I had one like that of my grandmother!', '2007-02-08 19:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345552, 463721, 50255, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is awesome.</td>', 'Wow...this is awesome.', '2007-02-08 19:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345557, 463708, 50255, '<td valign="top">This is soooooo creative.  Love it!</td>', 'This is soooooo creative.  Love it!', '2007-02-08 19:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345563, 464875, 50255, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice composition.</td>', 'This is such a nice composition.', '2007-02-08 19:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345565, 465024, 50255, '<td valign="top">Really nice job.</td>', 'Really nice job.', '2007-02-08 19:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345570, 463297, 66515, '<td valign="top">I would like to see how this would be if the horizon line were raised up about an inch higher. (Either by pointing camera lower or getting down lower for the shot). As it is you''ve cut your shot in half. The subject of your picture is the crops whereas the sky is just a complimentary element. By showing more of the field you place higher emphasis on it and therefore make the viewer KNOW that its the subject rather than having them visually debate which is the subject: sky or field. Intellectually they know what the subject is but you have to tell their eyes what to see. <br/> <br/>I do like the colors you captured and the sky is quite nice and does actually work well here despite what I said above. More of the puddles in the foreground would tie this with the title a bit more. <br/> <br/>In terms of it relativity to the challenge I like it a lot. Its creative and is sort of a "salt of the earth" approach. Really great idea!<br/> <br/>Overall, I would give this a 7.</td>', 'I would like to see how this would be if the horizon line were raised up about an inch higher. (Either by pointing camera lower or getting down lower for the shot). As it is you''ve cut your shot in half. The subject of your picture is the crops whereas the sky is just a complimentary element. By showing more of the field you place higher emphasis on it and therefore make the viewer KNOW that its the subject rather than having them visually debate which is the subject: sky or field. Intellectually they know what the subject is but you have to tell their eyes what to see.  I do like the colors you captured and the sky is quite nice and does actually work well here despite what I said above. More of the puddles in the foreground would tie this with the title a bit more.  In terms of it relativity to the challenge I like it a lot. Its creative and is sort of a "salt of the earth" approach. Really great idea! Overall, I would give this a 7.', '2007-02-08 19:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345576, 463229, 50255, '<td valign="top">Exposure looks perfect but it looks like it slants a bit to the right and that''s throwing me off.  You might also try a tighter crop to see how that looks...just a thought.</td>', 'Exposure looks perfect but it looks like it slants a bit to the right and that''s throwing me off.  You might also try a tighter crop to see how that looks...just a thought.', '2007-02-08 19:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345580, 465043, 50255, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  She looks like a sweetie.</td>', 'Very nice.  She looks like a sweetie.', '2007-02-08 19:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345584, 465014, 66515, '<td valign="top">Far too dark. I can''t see the subject really at all.</td>', 'Far too dark. I can''t see the subject really at all.', '2007-02-08 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345592, 461849, 50255, '<td valign="top">The white balance on this looks a bit blue.  Very sweet emotional pull though.  Nice capture.</td>', 'The white balance on this looks a bit blue.  Very sweet emotional pull though.  Nice capture.', '2007-02-08 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345594, 464782, 50255, '<td valign="top">Nice setup.</td>', 'Nice setup.', '2007-02-08 19:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345596, 464632, 50255, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.</td>', 'Awesome shot.', '2007-02-08 19:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345603, 463229, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here. Compositionally a little static. Had you placed Him higher or lower in the scene would have been more visually appealing. I would say higher so that the horizontal portion of the cross is right smack dab on the one the thirds lines. It wouldn''t take much either. A step forward and you''d probably would have it.</td>', 'I like the idea here. Compositionally a little static. Had you placed Him higher or lower in the scene would have been more visually appealing. I would say higher so that the horizontal portion of the cross is right smack dab on the one the thirds lines. It wouldn''t take much either. A step forward and you''d probably would have it.', '2007-02-08 19:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345604, 463669, 50255, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft.  Nice setup though.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft.  Nice setup though.', '2007-02-08 19:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345607, 463950, 50255, '<td valign="top">What a sweet shot.</td>', 'What a sweet shot.', '2007-02-08 19:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345611, 464315, 50255, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft.', '2007-02-08 19:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345617, 464253, 66515, '<td valign="top">This has a tilted feeling to it but I like how you used the branches to frame the shot.</td>', 'This has a tilted feeling to it but I like how you used the branches to frame the shot.', '2007-02-08 19:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345620, 462968, 66952, '<td valign="top">Awesome! 10!</td>', 'Awesome! 10!', '2007-02-08 19:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345623, 463480, 50255, '<td valign="top">This has "ribbon" written all over it!</td>', 'This has "ribbon" written all over it!', '2007-02-08 19:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345625, 463899, 66515, '<td valign="top">Hmm...good bokeh too! This would go from good to great had you used a bit more depth of field for the subject to get the whole dandelion head in focus. One or two stops would probably be all it would take I think.</td>', 'Hmm...good bokeh too! This would go from good to great had you used a bit more depth of field for the subject to get the whole dandelion head in focus. One or two stops would probably be all it would take I think.', '2007-02-08 19:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345630, 464735, 66515, '<td valign="top">Too small for starters. Use the whole allowable size when submitting (or close to it).<br/> <br/>The sky is far too dark and oversaturated. <br/> <br/>I like how you have approached the challenge however. This is an interesting take on "good" and one that I don''t believe I have seen yet.</td>', 'Too small for starters. Use the whole allowable size when submitting (or close to it). The sky is far too dark and oversaturated.  I like how you have approached the challenge however. This is an interesting take on "good" and one that I don''t believe I have seen yet.', '2007-02-08 19:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345632, 464209, 50255, '<td valign="top">Major creativity points!!</td>', 'Major creativity points!!', '2007-02-08 19:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345633, 462797, 66515, '<td valign="top">The book looks like it is one big block of paper if you look close to the spine. There are no details showing that there are actual pages in the book in that area.</td>', 'The book looks like it is one big block of paper if you look close to the spine. There are no details showing that there are actual pages in the book in that area.', '2007-02-08 19:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345635, 464408, 50255, '<td valign="top">Incredible.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Incredible.  Congratulations.', '2007-02-08 19:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345638, 464031, 66515, '<td valign="top">A little noisy but that aside I like the shot you captured. I like the lighting that you captured as well.</td>', 'A little noisy but that aside I like the shot you captured. I like the lighting that you captured as well.', '2007-02-08 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345646, 463997, 66515, '<td valign="top">I know we all don''t speak French on this site but the translation in the title may be a little bit extraneous and a bit insulting to our intelligence.<br/> <br/>You captured some interesting shadows on the bow of the boat and I really like the detail in the clouds.</td>', 'I know we all don''t speak French on this site but the translation in the title may be a little bit extraneous and a bit insulting to our intelligence. You captured some interesting shadows on the bow of the boat and I really like the detail in the clouds.', '2007-02-08 19:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345653, 464244, 66515, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here. Perhaps if it was just the hand it would be a bit stronger. You also don''t have to tell us that thumbs up is good. I think we might already know that. Helping the viewer out with the title is one thing but you don''t have to thump them over the head with it. <br/> <br/>That aside I like the detail shown in the hand. The person is really just a distraction. When you are composing, decide what you want to be the subject and then decide what elements to add to that. (I should maybe try that out myself now that I think of it.)</td>', 'I like the idea here. Perhaps if it was just the hand it would be a bit stronger. You also don''t have to tell us that thumbs up is good. I think we might already know that. Helping the viewer out with the title is one thing but you don''t have to thump them over the head with it.  That aside I like the detail shown in the hand. The person is really just a distraction. When you are composing, decide what you want to be the subject and then decide what elements to add to that. (I should maybe try that out myself now that I think of it.)', '2007-02-08 19:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345655, 464720, 66515, '<td valign="top">A bit tilted. I like the silhouette effect here and the detail in the clouds. The subtlety of the landscape in the background is also a nice touch.</td>', 'A bit tilted. I like the silhouette effect here and the detail in the clouds. The subtlety of the landscape in the background is also a nice touch.', '2007-02-08 19:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345659, 464790, 30822, '<td valign="top">Image is to washed out and lacking contrast IMHO.</td>', 'Image is to washed out and lacking contrast IMHO.', '2007-02-08 19:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345662, 464944, 30822, '<td valign="top">Cut kid. Possibly zoom in closer to include more face, blanket on left is distracting IMHO.</td>', 'Cut kid. Possibly zoom in closer to include more face, blanket on left is distracting IMHO.', '2007-02-08 19:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345663, 464502, 30822, '<td valign="top">To dark IMHO</td>', 'To dark IMHO', '2007-02-08 19:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345665, 465095, 30822, '<td valign="top">Very cute, but lighting is a bit harsh IMHO. 5</td>', 'Very cute, but lighting is a bit harsh IMHO. 5', '2007-02-08 19:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345671, 465001, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. Unfortunately your subject''s head is visually glued into the tree. You need to either move her away from the tree or provide lighting that will help the viewer see the separation.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. Unfortunately your subject''s head is visually glued into the tree. You need to either move her away from the tree or provide lighting that will help the viewer see the separation.', '2007-02-08 19:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345672, 464744, 30822, '<td valign="top">Excellent job capturing emotions. Great pick techmically also. 10</td>', 'Excellent job capturing emotions. Great pick techmically also. 10', '2007-02-08 19:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345674, 463711, 30822, '<td valign="top">Very cute, but the light seems a bit to harsh IMHO.5</td>', 'Very cute, but the light seems a bit to harsh IMHO.5', '2007-02-08 19:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345676, 462755, 43656, '<td valign="top">I like the symmmetry, and the balance of light between inside and outside</td>', 'I like the symmmetry, and the balance of light between inside and outside', '2007-02-08 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345677, 465016, 30822, '<td valign="top">Eyes are a bit soft and back of body is overexposed IMHO. 5</td>', 'Eyes are a bit soft and back of body is overexposed IMHO. 5', '2007-02-08 19:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345681, 465014, 30822, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I can''t tell what this is and the title dosen''t help.</td>', 'I''m sorry but I can''t tell what this is and the title dosen''t help.', '2007-02-08 19:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345685, 464880, 43656, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, pose, DOF, maybe a little blow out in the corner.<br/>Very nice....I wish I had more shots like this in my family album.</td>', 'Nice subject, pose, DOF, maybe a little blow out in the corner.Very nice....I wish I had more shots like this in my family album.', '2007-02-08 19:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345690, 464269, 73452, '<td valign="top">I would have liked it if you would have not put any text, no cloud thing, and just did a crop on his face.  With a bit of his wings in the backround.</td>', 'I would have liked it if you would have not put any text, no cloud thing, and just did a crop on his face.  With a bit of his wings in the backround.', '2007-02-08 19:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345691, 464965, 30822, '<td valign="top">Flash in the foreground is overlit. Very distracting IMHO. 5</td>', 'Flash in the foreground is overlit. Very distracting IMHO. 5', '2007-02-08 19:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345692, 462455, 73452, '<td valign="top">great picture, love how you can still see some of the green in the leaves</td>', 'great picture, love how you can still see some of the green in the leaves', '2007-02-08 19:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345706, 463741, 43656, '<td valign="top">I like including the 2nd picture in the composition as if thats where she''ll go next.  It may be more contemplative if you had not included the coat and purse.</td>', 'I like including the 2nd picture in the composition as if thats where she''ll go next.  It may be more contemplative if you had not included the coat and purse.', '2007-02-08 20:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345711, 464408, 43656, '<td valign="top">Wow, brings back memories</td>', 'Wow, brings back memories', '2007-02-08 20:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
