(3345736, 462700, 52130, '<td valign="top">great job with the composition. I wish the sky was a darker blue, but that doesn''t affect my scoe. 8</td>', 'great job with the composition. I wish the sky was a darker blue, but that doesn''t affect my scoe. 8', '2007-02-08 20:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
