(3345815, 464417, 52130, '<td valign="top">beautiful, I wish it was bigger</td>', 'beautiful, I wish it was bigger', '2007-02-08 20:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345830, 464782, 36382, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the green tones, but that''s probably just me.  I can see how green ties in with the environment.  I do really like the dof.  How the bulbs in the background are nice and blurry, but you can still easily make them out.  I like the sharpness and lines of the good bulb.  Overall I think it''s a very good picture and will probably be near the top in this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Not sure I like the green tones, but that''s probably just me.  I can see how green ties in with the environment.  I do really like the dof.  How the bulbs in the background are nice and blurry, but you can still easily make them out.  I like the sharpness and lines of the good bulb.  Overall I think it''s a very good picture and will probably be near the top in this challenge.  Good luck.', '2007-02-08 20:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345891, 463315, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice image, warm tones and colors. I like the composition, but I think the title doesnt'' work and is going drag it down here... (I, for one, don''t like it).<br/>Not sure if was done on purpose not to have the whiter border on rhw right side...</td>', 'Nice image, warm tones and colors. I like the composition, but I think the title doesnt'' work and is going drag it down here... (I, for one, don''t like it).Not sure if was done on purpose not to have the whiter border on rhw right side...', '2007-02-08 20:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345933, 462968, 64446, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but that''s a bad image with a bad title.</td>', 'Sorry, but that''s a bad image with a bad title.', '2007-02-08 21:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3345941, 464967, 12733, '<td valign="top">He''s very cute, but his nose is out of focus and his right eye is blacked out. Also a lot of blur on one ear (or is that his tail sticking out past his head?)</td>', 'He''s very cute, but his nose is out of focus and his right eye is blacked out. Also a lot of blur on one ear (or is that his tail sticking out past his head?)', '2007-02-08 21:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
