(3345974, 464984, 64446, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and sky. Two things I''d like to suggest to improve this image: (1) make it larger (you can use up to 640 pixels wide) and (2) crop the left post off (maybe even all the tree foliage too).</td>', 'Nice colors and sky. Two things I''d like to suggest to improve this image: (1) make it larger (you can use up to 640 pixels wide) and (2) crop the left post off (maybe even all the tree foliage too).', '2007-02-08 21:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
