(3348207, 464745, 27514, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea, I really like the shot you were going for here. I do have some critque though, you have your subject lite from under the plane of his nose. when you do that it looks like the subject is sitting around a campfire. Your color is also very green, some color corecting would have been some major help to this image.  Your midtones and shadows are also very flat, a curves adjustment may also be in order.<br/> <br/>that said there are some good things about this image too, it''s compostion is really nice and the expression cought is very well done too.</td>', 'not a bad idea, I really like the shot you were going for here. I do have some critque though, you have your subject lite from under the plane of his nose. when you do that it looks like the subject is sitting around a campfire. Your color is also very green, some color corecting would have been some major help to this image.  Your midtones and shadows are also very flat, a curves adjustment may also be in order. that said there are some good things about this image too, it''s compostion is really nice and the expression cought is very well done too.', '2007-02-09 16:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348213, 464744, 69102, '<td valign="top">excellent idea for the challenge. i was actually surprised that we didn''t see more photos of aid workers, cops, etc. i''m assuming this a candid and not a studio setup, so well shot with good interaction between all the people in the frame. the exact nature of the aid isn''t necessarily clear, but the woman''s distress and the man''s comfort to her is. kudos - 8.</td>', 'excellent idea for the challenge. i was actually surprised that we didn''t see more photos of aid workers, cops, etc. i''m assuming this a candid and not a studio setup, so well shot with good interaction between all the people in the frame. the exact nature of the aid isn''t necessarily clear, but the woman''s distress and the man''s comfort to her is. kudos - 8.', '2007-02-09 16:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348214, 464807, 27514, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how you can make good out of this image. I like the image, it''s very cute moment cought, and you will be glad yo uhave this when the children grow up, but iho it don''t think it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not sure how you can make good out of this image. I like the image, it''s very cute moment cought, and you will be glad yo uhave this when the children grow up, but iho it don''t think it meets the challenge.', '2007-02-09 16:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348217, 462968, 69102, '<td valign="top">a brown attempt? here, i''ll help - 3.</td>', 'a brown attempt? here, i''ll help - 3.', '2007-02-09 16:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348220, 464330, 27514, '<td valign="top">wow, what a cute face! I really like the expression, though I think it lacks some technicals. the lighting is really just flat, meaning there isn''t much shadows created by your light source. I''m assuming you used on camera flash here and the catch lights in the baby''s eyes are in the dead cener of the eye making it both flat and a little weird to look at. <br/> <br/>again I love the expression though, and with kids that is more then half the battle. mabey use some light from a window next time and I think you will be in business.</td>', 'wow, what a cute face! I really like the expression, though I think it lacks some technicals. the lighting is really just flat, meaning there isn''t much shadows created by your light source. I''m assuming you used on camera flash here and the catch lights in the baby''s eyes are in the dead cener of the eye making it both flat and a little weird to look at.  again I love the expression though, and with kids that is more then half the battle. mabey use some light from a window next time and I think you will be in business.', '2007-02-09 16:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348225, 464661, 27514, '<td valign="top">slective desat works from some image, though i don''t think it does for this one. with that said though, you did a very nice job doing it. i like the compostion and the visual movement in the frame. i don''t see a top 10 finish here but I don''t think the image is all that hateful.</td>', 'slective desat works from some image, though i don''t think it does for this one. with that said though, you did a very nice job doing it. i like the compostion and the visual movement in the frame. i don''t see a top 10 finish here but I don''t think the image is all that hateful.', '2007-02-09 16:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348228, 464338, 69102, '<td valign="top">okay, this made me spit my coffee all over my monitor (but not in a "good" way)<br/>seriously though . . . why you got to go and do that to the poor dog? despite the torture of household pets (which I too enjoy, if not to your extent), the picture is still pretty poor. looks like you used the on camera flash and the lighting is too harsh, with the background completely lost. thanks for the laugh, though.</td>', 'okay, this made me spit my coffee all over my monitor (but not in a "good" way)seriously though . . . why you got to go and do that to the poor dog? despite the torture of household pets (which I too enjoy, if not to your extent), the picture is still pretty poor. looks like you used the on camera flash and the lighting is too harsh, with the background completely lost. thanks for the laugh, though.', '2007-02-09 16:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348229, 465036, 69102, '<td valign="top">a bit of a stretch for the "good" idea, isn''t it?</td>', 'a bit of a stretch for the "good" idea, isn''t it?', '2007-02-09 16:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348232, 463932, 69102, '<td valign="top">just blah. lighting is flat, subject isn''t that interesting. beed a better way to convey the idea.</td>', 'just blah. lighting is flat, subject isn''t that interesting. beed a better way to convey the idea.', '2007-02-09 16:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348237, 464241, 69102, '<td valign="top">i guess i can get the concept you are going for, but the execution of the shot is very poor. lighting is flat and composition is jumbled and distracting, there is no solid point of interest in the shot and too much clutter. sorry -3.</td>', 'i guess i can get the concept you are going for, but the execution of the shot is very poor. lighting is flat and composition is jumbled and distracting, there is no solid point of interest in the shot and too much clutter. sorry -3.', '2007-02-09 16:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348241, 465067, 69102, '<td valign="top">really like this shot, and pretty much the only pet shot that actually seems to have been conceived with the concept of the challenge in mind. lighting is excellent, the pose of the dog is also very nice conveying a sense of loyalty and readiness to serve. the camera adds a whimsical element. well done - 8.</td>', 'really like this shot, and pretty much the only pet shot that actually seems to have been conceived with the concept of the challenge in mind. lighting is excellent, the pose of the dog is also very nice conveying a sense of loyalty and readiness to serve. the camera adds a whimsical element. well done - 8.', '2007-02-09 16:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348242, 465099, 27514, '<td valign="top">this image is just a little off to me. the idea is nice I guess but the techincals just are not there. the hands are acward, especialy the one on the left. the rose is in focus and that is good, but the composition is not doing much of anything in he way of story telling, and the bottom of the left hand is cut off. the leaves on the rose look a little bug eaten and the outer pedals look roughed up as well.</td>', 'this image is just a little off to me. the idea is nice I guess but the techincals just are not there. the hands are acward, especialy the one on the left. the rose is in focus and that is good, but the composition is not doing much of anything in he way of story telling, and the bottom of the left hand is cut off. the leaves on the rose look a little bug eaten and the outer pedals look roughed up as well.', '2007-02-09 16:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348246, 462950, 69102, '<td valign="top">good. creative interpretation of the subject and a well shot photo. like the somewhat nontraditional composition: usually would see this shot framed so that the bullseye was in the lower left with the dart moving up into the upper right (closer and filling the frame more with the two elements), but this slightly different framing makes you stop and take a second look. like the colors as well. well done - 8.</td>', 'good. creative interpretation of the subject and a well shot photo. like the somewhat nontraditional composition: usually would see this shot framed so that the bullseye was in the lower left with the dart moving up into the upper right (closer and filling the frame more with the two elements), but this slightly different framing makes you stop and take a second look. like the colors as well. well done - 8.', '2007-02-09 16:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348247, 463070, 27514, '<td valign="top">wow, what a great image. I love how the light is just right and the placement of the subject is very very nice. with that said the color seems a little off, I know your title iludes to the fact that this is done on purpose but I don''t think dpc voters will see that. overall i really like this image though, looks like a still from a very good day of hikeing maybe.</td>', 'wow, what a great image. I love how the light is just right and the placement of the subject is very very nice. with that said the color seems a little off, I know your title iludes to the fact that this is done on purpose but I don''t think dpc voters will see that. overall i really like this image though, looks like a still from a very good day of hikeing maybe.', '2007-02-09 16:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348254, 463480, 69102, '<td valign="top">a nice shot that rises well above the majority of the "baby" shots in this challenge. the expression of the child, plus the addition of the mother and the interaction between the two works well to convey the idea of "good" to the viewer. the backlighting as well gives the pair an iconic impression-not just this mother and this baby, but a representative pair of the "goodness" that is the mother/baby bond. well done - 8.</td>', 'a nice shot that rises well above the majority of the "baby" shots in this challenge. the expression of the child, plus the addition of the mother and the interaction between the two works well to convey the idea of "good" to the viewer. the backlighting as well gives the pair an iconic impression-not just this mother and this baby, but a representative pair of the "goodness" that is the mother/baby bond. well done - 8.', '2007-02-09 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348258, 462265, 69102, '<td valign="top">thank you, thank you, thank you for taking the playing card idea for the challenge and interjecting some creativity into it to produce an interesting and well-made shot. elements are well chosen and arranged. like that you used a use set of cards, goes well with the other elements and the warm lighting. nice use of shallow dof. one of two highest scores of 9 for this challenge.</td>', 'thank you, thank you, thank you for taking the playing card idea for the challenge and interjecting some creativity into it to produce an interesting and well-made shot. elements are well chosen and arranged. like that you used a use set of cards, goes well with the other elements and the warm lighting. nice use of shallow dof. one of two highest scores of 9 for this challenge.', '2007-02-09 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3348267, 463295, 69102, '<td valign="top">very well shot and creative. one of two highest scores of 9 for this challenge.</td>', 'very well shot and creative. one of two highest scores of 9 for this challenge.', '2007-02-09 16:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
