(3348977, 465067, 58247, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot! The pose of the dog is one that personifies loyalty and devotion, exactly what characterizes a "good dog". Technically it is very pleasing also. The DOF is good and the lighting is just right. Having the angle of the light coming from the left and being a single light source adds to the stature of the dog''s stance which is a very loyal stance. The only thing bothers me is the dust, or sctratches, or whatever it is on the floor around the dog. But that is me just being nitpicky. Very good idea and execution. :-)</td>', 'This is a really good shot! The pose of the dog is one that personifies loyalty and devotion, exactly what characterizes a "good dog". Technically it is very pleasing also. The DOF is good and the lighting is just right. Having the angle of the light coming from the left and being a single light source adds to the stature of the dog''s stance which is a very loyal stance. The only thing bothers me is the dust, or sctratches, or whatever it is on the floor around the dog. But that is me just being nitpicky. Very good idea and execution. :-)', '2007-02-09 19:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
