(3350075, 464735, 73541, '<td valign="top">good color, nice and sharp, no shadows on her legs and a not so dark left top corner and it would be a 9 for me</td>', 'good color, nice and sharp, no shadows on her legs and a not so dark left top corner and it would be a 9 for me', '2007-02-10 07:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350077, 463070, 73541, '<td valign="top">very appealing color, why did you chose to crop like this? to center the boy''s head?</td>', 'very appealing color, why did you chose to crop like this? to center the boy''s head?', '2007-02-10 07:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350080, 464691, 73541, '<td valign="top">maybe i don''t get the point, for me just a blurry, dark picture of a flower pot</td>', 'maybe i don''t get the point, for me just a blurry, dark picture of a flower pot', '2007-02-10 07:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350082, 464252, 73541, '<td valign="top">well, at least rotate please</td>', 'well, at least rotate please', '2007-02-10 07:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350083, 464881, 73541, '<td valign="top">works good in b/w</td>', 'works good in b/w', '2007-02-10 07:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350085, 464657, 73541, '<td valign="top">the close flash is deadly for skin tones</td>', 'the close flash is deadly for skin tones', '2007-02-10 07:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350087, 463542, 73541, '<td valign="top">very blueish snow</td>', 'very blueish snow', '2007-02-10 07:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350090, 465049, 73541, '<td valign="top">oh my god look at his face! baaaad shadow on her face</td>', 'oh my god look at his face! baaaad shadow on her face', '2007-02-10 07:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350095, 465057, 5746, '<td valign="top">She is definately good looking :) I have an impression if she lowered her chin it could help. This way, you are focused on her chin, lower lip and the ring of course. The most important element - the eyes are not the main subject in the portrait. I like the strand of hair, howerever if you want this to look wet (it looks a bit wet to me) maybe some water on her face could increase the impression.</td>', 'She is definately good looking :) I have an impression if she lowered her chin it could help. This way, you are focused on her chin, lower lip and the ring of course. The most important element - the eyes are not the main subject in the portrait. I like the strand of hair, howerever if you want this to look wet (it looks a bit wet to me) maybe some water on her face could increase the impression.', '2007-02-10 07:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350098, 464632, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus here. Nice portrait.</td>', 'I like the soft focus here. Nice portrait.', '2007-02-10 07:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350102, 463315, 5746, '<td valign="top">The title "Good house wife" or "Good cook" would probably add you a few points and you wouldn''t have to explain yourself in the title :) Nice idea, well executed. A litlle more exposure to bring out whites in her cloths could make it a magazine illustration.</td>', 'The title "Good house wife" or "Good cook" would probably add you a few points and you wouldn''t have to explain yourself in the title :) Nice idea, well executed. A litlle more exposure to bring out whites in her cloths could make it a magazine illustration.', '2007-02-10 07:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350104, 463741, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like your idea. I feel there is something good about the girl as well, as not many young people enjoys museums or galleries those days :)</td>', 'I like your idea. I feel there is something good about the girl as well, as not many young people enjoys museums or galleries those days :)', '2007-02-10 07:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350110, 464782, 5746, '<td valign="top">The green colour disturbs me a bit, but it''s just a matter of taste. Personally I would prefer blue for this subject. Great detail and DOF. I like your composition also. The ordinary three bulbs in the background are great touch. It would''ve been also great Personification entry (the bulbs are afraid or jelous :))</td>', 'The green colour disturbs me a bit, but it''s just a matter of taste. Personally I would prefer blue for this subject. Great detail and DOF. I like your composition also. The ordinary three bulbs in the background are great touch. It would''ve been also great Personification entry (the bulbs are afraid or jelous :))', '2007-02-10 07:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350116, 463997, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Looks like really good sensation to travel with it.</td>', 'Great capture. Looks like really good sensation to travel with it.', '2007-02-10 07:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350119, 464317, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like your subject and title. It is good indeed. Not to strong and not too soft. The texture is very interesting making it pleasant too look at. Fresh idea in this challenge.</td>', 'I like your subject and title. It is good indeed. Not to strong and not too soft. The texture is very interesting making it pleasant too look at. Fresh idea in this challenge.', '2007-02-10 07:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350123, 465067, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. The dog looks like a scuplture and has beautiful shine. I don''t know, what the Canon has to do with it :)</td>', 'Nice portrait. The dog looks like a scuplture and has beautiful shine. I don''t know, what the Canon has to do with it :)', '2007-02-10 07:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350124, 463540, 5746, '<td valign="top">There is something wrong with the light on top of the book. I think backlight could make a better effect, creating some glowing edges.</td>', 'There is something wrong with the light on top of the book. I think backlight could make a better effect, creating some glowing edges.', '2007-02-10 08:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350126, 464256, 5746, '<td valign="top">Very freash idea for this challenge. I like your model and I love his expression. Nice use of negative space also. Not sure how it will do here on DPC, since the boy is not smiling nicely, but this is what makes this picture.</td>', 'Very freash idea for this challenge. I like your model and I love his expression. Nice use of negative space also. Not sure how it will do here on DPC, since the boy is not smiling nicely, but this is what makes this picture.', '2007-02-10 08:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350136, 465024, 5746, '<td valign="top">Good idea and message. I wonder what this white spots are on a red cross. The composition is very good.</td>', 'Good idea and message. I wonder what this white spots are on a red cross. The composition is very good.', '2007-02-10 08:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350139, 464116, 5746, '<td valign="top">The head is cropped to harshly I think.</td>', 'The head is cropped to harshly I think.', '2007-02-10 08:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350154, 464337, 5746, '<td valign="top">I like the subject and composition. I don''t get the connection with the "good night", but the abstract feel of this picture is appealing.</td>', 'I like the subject and composition. I don''t get the connection with the "good night", but the abstract feel of this picture is appealing.', '2007-02-10 08:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350167, 464779, 5746, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. 9</td>', 'Great portrait. 9', '2007-02-10 08:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350168, 464744, 5746, '<td valign="top">Nice idea well executed. The lighting makes it look a bit like a studio shot. I love the man in the door expression. It adds more "real" feeling. I really like the idea. 8</td>', 'Nice idea well executed. The lighting makes it look a bit like a studio shot. I love the man in the door expression. It adds more "real" feeling. I really like the idea. 8', '2007-02-10 08:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3350169, 464976, 5746, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture :) 8.</td>', 'Lovely picture :) 8.', '2007-02-10 08:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
