(3351045, 463668, 66952, '<td valign="top">Good idea, I like the theme, and the arrangement of flags in the scene. But there are a couple of things wrong with the processing. It''s <b>way</b> oversharpened, there are halos and jaggies around the edges of each stripe. The second thing is a general darkness. The white stripes on the flags are about a medium grey. You might read the black and white conversion tutorial to get some ideas for how to get the b&amp;w conversion to work.</td>', 'Good idea, I like the theme, and the arrangement of flags in the scene. But there are a couple of things wrong with the processing. It''s way oversharpened, there are halos and jaggies around the edges of each stripe. The second thing is a general darkness. The white stripes on the flags are about a medium grey. You might read the black and white conversion tutorial to get some ideas for how to get the b&w conversion to work.', '2007-02-10 15:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3351046, 464984, 66952, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, yes. I took this same shot a few months ago....Nice and sharp, and nice colors. I think there are other places in the park where you can take this same shot without the bushes blocking the bottom 1/3 of the castle, and where you won''t have to be shooting upwards so much. The lampposts leaning backwards is the clue that you''re aiming upwards.</td>', 'Ahhh, yes. I took this same shot a few months ago....Nice and sharp, and nice colors. I think there are other places in the park where you can take this same shot without the bushes blocking the bottom 1/3 of the castle, and where you won''t have to be shooting upwards so much. The lampposts leaning backwards is the clue that you''re aiming upwards.', '2007-02-10 15:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3351047, 464820, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice composition</td>', 'Nice composition', '2007-02-10 15:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
