(3359796, 464779, 60195, '<td valign="top">So I''m normally not a big fan of kid entries, but after scoring the majority of this challenge, I happen upon this.  Finally... a good shot. Thank you for giving my eyes a break (and thank you for knowing what the focus ring is for). This has great lighting, a great pose, and overall wonderful feel (extra points for making me stop and write this). Easily the best shot in the challenge.  Nice work = 9   :O)</td>', 'So I''m normally not a big fan of kid entries, but after scoring the majority of this challenge, I happen upon this.  Finally... a good shot. Thank you for giving my eyes a break (and thank you for knowing what the focus ring is for). This has great lighting, a great pose, and overall wonderful feel (extra points for making me stop and write this). Easily the best shot in the challenge.  Nice work = 9   :O)', '2007-02-13 01:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
