(3363283, 465105, 50695, '<td valign="top">what is the cat looking at? yes, it is really important to know what the cat is looking at, because as we all know, cats only look at very interesting things, things that are much more interesting to look at than cats. why look at a cat? in fact, why take a photograph? why not just follow your cat around and see what it''s looking at, and then report back to us?</td>', 'what is the cat looking at? yes, it is really important to know what the cat is looking at, because as we all know, cats only look at very interesting things, things that are much more interesting to look at than cats. why look at a cat? in fact, why take a photograph? why not just follow your cat around and see what it''s looking at, and then report back to us?', '2007-02-14 00:30:37.000000', NULL, 0),
