(3363462, 465106, 50641, '<td valign="top">This is pretty! I like your centering and of course the perspective, oh, and the frame works too.  Possibly maybe I  might give this a bump in contrast, noise reduction or saturation - maybe all three - but I guess that''s the dpc warping talking.  Or maybe you pulled this out of deep shadows and it won''t bump anymore?  Amusing take on the challenge too - making the idiom literal.  Don''t be too sad about the score - clearly a bunch of people did like it pretty well :)</td>', 'This is pretty! I like your centering and of course the perspective, oh, and the frame works too.  Possibly maybe I  might give this a bump in contrast, noise reduction or saturation - maybe all three - but I guess that''s the dpc warping talking.  Or maybe you pulled this out of deep shadows and it won''t bump anymore?  Amusing take on the challenge too - making the idiom literal.  Don''t be too sad about the score - clearly a bunch of people did like it pretty well :)', '2007-02-14 01:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(3363468, 464256, 49643, '<td valign="top">Thanks for voting &amp; commenting on this photograph. I replied to some voters earlier about the clarification about the title of image which I want to say other viewers also.<br/>I realized that what a wrong message can be sent through poor choice of image in contest.What was going in my mind is that the boy in the image is not physically too strong even though he is ready to fight,struggle which shows his positive mental attitude.<br/>Actually I didn''t like long titles so I always prefer short one but hope next time I don''t do this mistake.</td>', 'Thanks for voting & commenting on this photograph. I replied to some voters earlier about the clarification about the title of image which I want to say other viewers also.I realized that what a wrong message can be sent through poor choice of image in contest.What was going in my mind is that the boy in the image is not physically too strong even though he is ready to fight,struggle which shows his positive mental attitude.Actually I didn''t like long titles so I always prefer short one but hope next time I don''t do this mistake.', '2007-02-14 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 0),
