(3363603, 464790, 72887, '<td valign="top">thanks for voting and especially for comments. i think this photo is a prime example of different taste in different people as i liked soft/non intense colors a lot and actually desaturated image a little. i also have a version with bw background and only lions in color (but i could not use that one for basic editing).<br/> <br/>anyways thanks for your votes and input and will see you next time</td>', 'thanks for voting and especially for comments. i think this photo is a prime example of different taste in different people as i liked soft/non intense colors a lot and actually desaturated image a little. i also have a version with bw background and only lions in color (but i could not use that one for basic editing). anyways thanks for your votes and input and will see you next time', '2007-02-14 01:29:39.000000', NULL, 0),
