(3363636, 464356, 64795, '<td valign="top">You said you wanted a critique, so here you go! :)<br/> <br/>I do like the lighting in this, but I the focus seems a little off.  I also am not so sure if I like the angle.  At this angle, it seems as if nothing is popping out at me.  I just see a big bowl.  I think a different angle may serve you well.  But, what do I know?!?  :)<br/> <br/>Overall, good lighting and idea, but try a different angle, and if you want the DPC crowd to vote high, you have to have your focus spot-on.  I also have problems with this!<br/> <br/>Hopefully that helped,<br/>Leisha<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-14 01:37:27.</i></td>', 'You said you wanted a critique, so here you go! :) I do like the lighting in this, but I the focus seems a little off.  I also am not so sure if I like the angle.  At this angle, it seems as if nothing is popping out at me.  I just see a big bowl.  I think a different angle may serve you well.  But, what do I know?!?  :) Overall, good lighting and idea, but try a different angle, and if you want the DPC crowd to vote high, you have to have your focus spot-on.  I also have problems with this! Hopefully that helped,Leisha', '2007-02-14 01:37:13.000000', '2007-02-14 01:37:27.000000', 0),
