(3363798, 464356, 200, '<td valign="top">I totally disagree with daboardgirl. This is the coolest angle I have ever seen used on a toilet. You are obviously creative. I completely enjoyed seeing this shot in the challenge. As for focus, I think the softness lends itself well to the image. Dont get caught up in everything being extra super sharp then neat imaged to death only to take photos to win a ribbon with water droplets or completely set up scenarios that will hit voters over the head with bland two dimensional literal thinking. Keep your funky fun perspective. I look forward to seeing more!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I totally disagree with daboardgirl. This is the coolest angle I have ever seen used on a toilet. You are obviously creative. I completely enjoyed seeing this shot in the challenge. As for focus, I think the softness lends itself well to the image. Dont get caught up in everything being extra super sharp then neat imaged to death only to take photos to win a ribbon with water droplets or completely set up scenarios that will hit voters over the head with bland two dimensional literal thinking. Keep your funky fun perspective. I look forward to seeing more! ', '2007-02-14 02:43:47.000000', NULL, 0),
