(3364043, 464976, 50674, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot Sigrún! I guess you just sit there and look at this lovely little person for hours on end, he is beautiful and the shot is awesome.</td>', 'Fantastic shot Sigrún! I guess you just sit there and look at this lovely little person for hours on end, he is beautiful and the shot is awesome.', '2007-02-14 05:53:05.000000', NULL, 0),
