(3364086, 464312, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette and I like the layered "Rule of Thirds". Was this the Italy GTG? Did you explain the concept of "Team Suck" to them?</td>', 'Great silhouette and I like the layered "Rule of Thirds". Was this the Italy GTG? Did you explain the concept of "Team Suck" to them?', '2007-02-14 06:05:53.000000', NULL, 0),
