(3364478, 461849, 73222, '<td valign="top">I appreciate all the comments.  I''m no photographer by any means... this was my very FIRST ever, posted image for a challenge.<br/> <br/>I guess I should not have cropped, but didn''t figure anyone wanted to see all the toys at her feet.<br/> <br/>This was fun!  Guess I''ll leave the "real" picture taking to my pro photographer hubby.<br/> <br/>I look at it this way, for someone like me who is dyslexic... finding I made the top 20 rated... ''taint'' bad.  <br/> <br/>gini</td>', 'I appreciate all the comments.  I''m no photographer by any means... this was my very FIRST ever, posted image for a challenge. I guess I should not have cropped, but didn''t figure anyone wanted to see all the toys at her feet. This was fun!  Guess I''ll leave the "real" picture taking to my pro photographer hubby. I look at it this way, for someone like me who is dyslexic... finding I made the top 20 rated... ''taint'' bad.   gini', '2007-02-14 08:25:46.000000', NULL, 0),
