(3364648, 464967, 71060, '<td valign="top">By the way, the blur to the left of her head is her wagging tail. Also, the shadow on the left side of her face is intentional. And I liked that her right eye was the part most in focus. That said, I understand that it didn''t necessarily come across as planned. This was a last minut shot and I didn''t have my tripod, so I wasn''t expecting much from it. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the great comments!</td>', 'By the way, the blur to the left of her head is her wagging tail. Also, the shadow on the left side of her face is intentional. And I liked that her right eye was the part most in focus. That said, I understand that it didn''t necessarily come across as planned. This was a last minut shot and I didn''t have my tripod, so I wasn''t expecting much from it.  Thanks for the great comments!', '2007-02-14 09:14:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(3364670, 464417, 69668, '<td valign="top">Well I made a rookie mistake.  I should have increased the size.  Oh well, next time.  Thanks for all the great comments.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-14 09:21:08.</i></td>', 'Well I made a rookie mistake.  I should have increased the size.  Oh well, next time.  Thanks for all the great comments.', '2007-02-14 09:20:37.000000', '2007-02-14 09:21:08.000000', 0),
