(3365257, 462996, 5792, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the blue. Beautiful landscape. It has haloing around the right side mountains but otherwise a gorgeous composition. The western drought must be a lot worse than I thought. That looks more like late summer than winter. I always thought Yosemite was snowbound in winter. Global warming is taking it''s toll. :)</td>', 'Congrats on the blue. Beautiful landscape. It has haloing around the right side mountains but otherwise a gorgeous composition. The western drought must be a lot worse than I thought. That looks more like late summer than winter. I always thought Yosemite was snowbound in winter. Global warming is taking it''s toll. :)', '2007-02-14 11:22:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3365341, 462926, 5112, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!  Beautiful image, yawn, laugh, it''s beautiful anyway.</td>', 'Congratulations!  Beautiful image, yawn, laugh, it''s beautiful anyway.', '2007-02-14 12:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
