(3365462, 464782, 24454, '<td valign="top">Yes!  Very nicely done.  The lighting is awesome, and the concept is very creative.  Congratulations on a front page finish!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yes!  Very nicely done.  The lighting is awesome, and the concept is very creative.  Congratulations on a front page finish! ', '2007-02-14 12:46:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(3365475, 463614, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, Aimee!  Your creativity just blows my mind.  And Deb''s right.  It looks like beautiful warm weather.  This is wonderful!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, Aimee!  Your creativity just blows my mind.  And Deb''s right.  It looks like beautiful warm weather.  This is wonderful! ', '2007-02-14 12:50:19.000000', NULL, 0),
