(3365534, 464312, 24454, '<td valign="top">This was yours????   You are so right!  I DO love this one!  I thought it was one of those California guys showing off another one of their spectacular sunsets.  This is really awesome!   Since I gave it a 9, I think it is sadly underrated :(    But still a nice strong finish.<br/> <br/></td>', 'This was yours????   You are so right!  I DO love this one!  I thought it was one of those California guys showing off another one of their spectacular sunsets.  This is really awesome!   Since I gave it a 9, I think it is sadly underrated :(    But still a nice strong finish. ', '2007-02-14 13:03:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3365549, 464502, 24454, '<td valign="top">Brian, this is AWESOME!!!!   One of your best!  The snow white birds against that dark night time brush. . .EXCELLENT!!!   Surprised this one didn''t finish higher -- but that''s still a pretty darn good finish!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Brian, this is AWESOME!!!!   One of your best!  The snow white birds against that dark night time brush. . .EXCELLENT!!!   Surprised this one didn''t finish higher -- but that''s still a pretty darn good finish! ', '2007-02-14 13:05:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(3365613, 462968, 20168, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and the "1" votes! At the time of DQ this photo was scoring a 2.6 and I was happily heading toward another brown ribbon. Oops though. I admitted to adding a blur filter when request came for verification. Forget those pesky basic rules. Whiterook still rules the cellar of DPC!</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and the "1" votes! At the time of DQ this photo was scoring a 2.6 and I was happily heading toward another brown ribbon. Oops though. I admitted to adding a blur filter when request came for verification. Forget those pesky basic rules. Whiterook still rules the cellar of DPC!', '2007-02-14 13:21:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3365643, 462968, 51538, '<td valign="top">Too contrived.  You''ll never achieve the nadir of the Rook.  Contrived is simply not in his style.</td>', 'Too contrived.  You''ll never achieve the nadir of the Rook.  Contrived is simply not in his style.', '2007-02-14 13:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3365651, 464352, 62244, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments, they were very useful. About the title I would like to appologise in case somebody felt offended. Didn''t mean that people that don''t go to church are bad. It was just a try to get a title with "good" in it. Should be more careful next time I guess! :-)</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments, they were very useful. About the title I would like to appologise in case somebody felt offended. Didn''t mean that people that don''t go to church are bad. It was just a try to get a title with "good" in it. Should be more careful next time I guess! :-)', '2007-02-14 13:33:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(3365669, 461777, 7889, '<td valign="top">Good work, a big improvement on your previous efforts!<br/> <br/>Mike<br/></td>', 'Good work, a big improvement on your previous efforts! Mike', '2007-02-14 13:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3366068, 464317, 67697, '<td valign="top">Hi Asim - nice capture of details and texture!  Did you find this photo was more striking in contrast compared to one done in color?  The sunlight really added something here.  Great job!</td>', 'Hi Asim - nice capture of details and texture!  Did you find this photo was more striking in contrast compared to one done in color?  The sunlight really added something here.  Great job!', '2007-02-14 14:56:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3366085, 465102, 67697, '<td valign="top">Whoo hoo Deb!  Your highest scoring pic!  Way to go!  Just one question - is that really their hair? lol.   I bet this was cute to watch.  Your pic makes me wish I was there to see it.  Good job!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-14 15:55:11.</i></td>', 'Whoo hoo Deb!  Your highest scoring pic!  Way to go!  Just one question - is that really their hair? lol.   I bet this was cute to watch.  Your pic makes me wish I was there to see it.  Good job!', '2007-02-14 14:59:52.000000', '2007-02-14 15:55:11.000000', 0),
(3366090, 465099, 67697, '<td valign="top">Lol John.  This is a great idea for the challenge!  Too bad one of the hands is out of focus.  I hope your wife enjoyed the chocolate and the rose!</td>', 'Lol John.  This is a great idea for the challenge!  Too bad one of the hands is out of focus.  I hope your wife enjoyed the chocolate and the rose!', '2007-02-14 15:00:58.000000', NULL, 0),
