(3369989, 465105, 53964, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition, but I think it would be more effective if the shadows were darker, especially on the cat. The gold is a lovely effect, but the brown makes it.... glary? :)</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition, but I think it would be more effective if the shadows were darker, especially on the cat. The gold is a lovely effect, but the brown makes it.... glary? :)', '2007-02-15 16:03:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3370008, 465048, 67258, '<td valign="top">The only ten I gave out in this challenge was to this photo - I really did expect to see it the top ten at the very least.  To me it nailed the challenge and the technicals are all good, especially the outstanding composition.   Most importantly, ''though, it tells a story and provides the viewer with a feast of visual stimulus, but without over-bombarding the senses.  Reviewing the photo again after close of voting, I stand by my vote of 10.  Good one!</td>', 'The only ten I gave out in this challenge was to this photo - I really did expect to see it the top ten at the very least.  To me it nailed the challenge and the technicals are all good, especially the outstanding composition.   Most importantly, ''though, it tells a story and provides the viewer with a feast of visual stimulus, but without over-bombarding the senses.  Reviewing the photo again after close of voting, I stand by my vote of 10.  Good one!', '2007-02-15 16:06:34.000000', NULL, 0),
