(3373625, 462968, 66952, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I gave you a 10, because it seemed too obvious that you were going for the brownie. I think with a less obvious title, I would have given you the 1 you so obviously deserved. Too bad about the DQ. Better luck next time.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-02-16 19:41:15.</i></td>', 'Sorry, I gave you a 10, because it seemed too obvious that you were going for the brownie. I think with a less obvious title, I would have given you the 1 you so obviously deserved. Too bad about the DQ. Better luck next time.', '2007-02-16 19:39:49.000000', '2007-02-16 19:41:15.000000', 0),
