(3374684, 464031, 66597, '<td valign="top">What a delightful old fellow he is :-) I can tell from the photo how much you love him. Since this challenge was basic editing, I think you did a very good job with post. If it were advanced, or for your own profile, a couple of minor suggestions would be to tone down that blown highlight on Buddy''s head (pulls eyes away from his face), brighten up the eyes, and select background then gaussian blur to reduce noise. Great pet portrait!</td>', 'What a delightful old fellow he is :-) I can tell from the photo how much you love him. Since this challenge was basic editing, I think you did a very good job with post. If it were advanced, or for your own profile, a couple of minor suggestions would be to tone down that blown highlight on Buddy''s head (pulls eyes away from his face), brighten up the eyes, and select background then gaussian blur to reduce noise. Great pet portrait!', '2007-02-17 08:57:23.000000', NULL, 0),
