(3492757, 464356, 64994, '<td valign="top">Holy Grail, love the title!! I like the angle and the lighting and do not agree with the OOF comment, I think it looks fine!! very creative and good comp. I think you got ripped on this one...I would give it a 6 or 7. My only real thought to improve might be to get rid of the bottle of whatever it is on the shelf in the upper left corner, that is a bit distracting to me, IMO.</td>', 'Holy Grail, love the title!! I like the angle and the lighting and do not agree with the OOF comment, I think it looks fine!! very creative and good comp. I think you got ripped on this one...I would give it a 6 or 7. My only real thought to improve might be to get rid of the bottle of whatever it is on the shelf in the upper left corner, that is a bit distracting to me, IMO.', '2007-03-28 02:03:19.000000', NULL, 0),
